equation therefore reduces to \eqn{\Phi(\lambda_w - z_\alpha)
= 1 - \beta}, giving the single-endpoint noncentrality parameter
\eqn{\lambda_w^{*}(\kappa, \beta, 1) = z_\alpha + z_\beta},
independent of \eqn{\kappa}.

